msgctxt "152"
msgid ""
"Good seeing you, Kiryu-san. Got a burning question to ask.\r\n"
"This new military base they keep going on about: yea or nay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "164"
msgid "(That's a good question...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "176"
msgid ""
"I know this isn't the most popular opinion around here, but I support it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "188"
msgid ""
"Hmmm... Interesting. To be perfectly frank with you, I'm not\r\n"
"convinced this island needs more bases."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "200"
msgid ""
"Keeping Asia stable is great, don't get me wrong. But when\r\n"
"are they going to start thinking about Okinawa's stability?\r\n"
"Those American soldiers are such a thorn in our bottoms..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "212"
msgid "I'm against it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "224"
msgid ""
"Ah, I knew we were kindred spirits, Kiryu-san! The people\r\n"
"of this island are sick and tired of the military imposing on our land."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "236"
msgid ""
"Besides, plopping more bases down is essentially saying\r\n"
"we're preparing for war. And when that war inevitably comes,\r\n"
"we'll be trapped in a combat zone with no escape in sight."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "248"
msgid ""
"Not to mention all this outrageous talk about erecting some\r\n"
"fancy-schmancy resort! As if that will finally make Okinawa prosperous!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "260"
msgid ""
"If you ask me, they're trying to tear down everything we've\r\n"
"worked for since the second World War... all for a little pocket change."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "272"
msgid "I don't really care either way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "284"
msgid ""
"Hmph! You may think you can \"opt out\" of this conversation\r\n"
"because you're from the mainland, but think about the poor\r\n"
"children you've taken under your wing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "296"
msgid ""
"What happens now will unquestionably impact their futures,\r\n"
"their childrens' futures, their childrens' childrens' future, and beyond!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "308"
msgid ""
"It's our responsibility as upstanding adults to set a good\r\n"
"example for them! To ensure the world they inherit from us\r\n"
"is a world worth living in!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "320"
msgid "I support it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "332"
msgid "I'm against it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "344"
msgid "I don't really care either way."
msgstr ""

